# "Tap Fishing Pole" needs the Pole untapped (CR 602.2b, 118.3, 701.26a). Bot1 activates the Memnite's ability on turn 3, which
# taps the Pole. Moving the tapped Pole to the Ornithopter (CR 301.5c) gives that untapped creature the ability, but it cannot
# be activated: its cost can't be paid. On turn 5 everything untaps, but the Ornithopter was never tapped, so the creature the
# Pole is attached to does not "become untapped" (CR 701.26b): no Fish, and the bait counter stays on the Pole. The Pole is
# untapped again, so the Ornithopter baits it a second time (two counters); on turn 7 the Ornithopter untaps and the trigger
# removes "a bait counter", one, not both (CR 122.1): one Fish and a counter left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Fishing Pole
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fishing Pole.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Activate(Ability: Equip; Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Counters.Bait = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Activate(Ability: Equip; Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Counters.Bait = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fish Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Counters.Bait = 2
[T7 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Counters.Bait = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Fishing Pole.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Fish Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Fish Token#2 = (absent)
